#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:96
#: 0b9a021ad04f44818923a9225a789dde
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:97
#: eaaea874c5b94f3d8abd071682181554
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这两种协议需要真正的"
" UART 连接）。但 FPort 以此方式连接时，仅提供 RC 而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:99
#: 8e4825e2025b422890be58ff472770cc
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL5 (UART2) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using UART2. "
":ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ""
"为支持 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的嵌入式数传，需使用完整 UART（如 SERIAL5（UART2））进行接收机连接。以下为使用 "
"UART2 的设置。:ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为 「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:101
#: 1f4597cf57a344de82e5aa445e8637e1
msgid ""
"FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` be set to "
"\"15\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:103
#: bbbfeddbce744933802017c91865b8a8
msgid ""
"CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` be set to \"0\"."
msgstr "CRSF 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:105
#: 70d781f676bf4c3d891a6a2a9a5e48e2
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" "
"and connects only the UART2 TX pin."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」，并仅连接 UART2 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:107
#: b237bc6e9dd8424fb383a6155cb9f723
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:110
#: f86642a53ddb4d1f87b0e787a41d0ab9
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:112
#: 03eea6364b2a4a6eb547116eb5363067
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk5x supports up to 16 PWM outputs. All 16 outputs support all "
"normal PWM output formats. All FMU outputs except 7 and 8 ,also support "
"DShot."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk5x 最多支持 16 路 PWM 输出。所有 16 路输出均支持普通 PWM 输出格式。除第 7 和第 8 路外，所有 FMU 输出均支持"
" DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:115
#: c37dd85f19f2401894e7387f3412e696
msgid "The 8 FMU PWM outputs are in 4 groups:"
msgstr "8 路 FMU PWM 输出分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:117
#: 3f1ee216252945df9b5495546ee49892
msgid "PWM 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2、3 和 4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:118
#: 0316e2f9bed9444a9d03ee774232cd9b
msgid "PWM 5 and 6 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5 和 6 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:119
#: dcb6bd709e8747d1bbc05ad95b536e48
msgid "PWM 7 and 8 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7 和 8 在第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-ph5x.rst:122
#: a13acb0a575c46598b21cacf271c9bfd
msgid ""
"FMU outputs within the same group need to use the same output rate and "
"protocol. If any output in a group uses DShot then all channels in that "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的 FMU 输出需使用相同的输出频率和协议。若某组内任一输出使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

